.001,0.001,0.001,0.002,0.001,0.001],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"As you hear the foul-mouthed lyrics of the Bosun off in the distance, you breathe a sigh of relief. One step closer to setting sail. You have time for one more stop, but you better be quick. Librarians hunt in multiple packs, and Neckbeard's likely to be pulling anchor soon.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.224,"end":18.08,"frac":0.961,"status":"ok","matched":49,"words":51},"large":{"start":0.224,"end":18.08,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":51,"words":51},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"Open your checklist, what will be your last stop?","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":18.912,"end":22.592,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":9},"large":{"start":18.912,"end":22.592,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"Head to your local legal establishment? Pirates may not like courtrooms or other legal holding stations, but they're a fine place to find scoundrels who may be amenable to the idea of a quick trip far away.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":23.264,"end":35.168,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":37},"large":{"start":23.264,"end":35.168,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":37},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"Or","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":35.744,"end":36.480000000000004,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"large":{"start":35.744,"end":35.98,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"differ":true},{"i":4,"text":"Head to the local store, where you can get a spare set of sails you're likely to need for the journey? Neckbeard is notorious for shooting cannon balls through those vital pieces of fabric, you need to be prepared.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":36.832,"end":48.768,"frac":0.897,"status":"ok","matched":35,"words":39},"large":{"start":36.832,"end":48.768,"frac":0.897,"status":"ok","matched":35,"words":39},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68fbf32b57126_JM6.jpg"}